\end{figure}

The vertical arrangement, depicted in \cref{fig:layers_side_view}, consists of a bottom heat source of thickness $t_{\text{chip}}$, an intermediary insulator of thickness $t_{\text{ins}}$, and the active TEC layer of thickness $t_{\text{TEC}}$.

